usage: numpydoc [-h] {render,validate,lint} ...

The CLI for numpydoc.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit

subcommands:
  {render,validate,lint}
    render              generate the RST docstring with numpydoc
    validate            validate the object's docstring and report errors
    lint                validate all docstrings in file(s) using the abstract
                        syntax tree
